    "plain_text": "Gabriel Andrés Castillo Bozo co-founded Seguros BBA in Panama with his brother Leopoldo in 2008. The insurer initially concentrated on motor policies but recorded losses during its early years. The brothers subscribed further capital as they developed the business.\n\nGabriel held a minority interest of 37.5 percent. The brothers placed their shares in a trust while retaining the beneficial interests. The trustee held the shares and exercised voting rights under their instructions. Gabriel transferred his interest to Leopoldo in 2016, and the trust was amended the following year to reflect his departure.",
